{"id":"vod_md_4511","vodId":"4511","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"机动武斗传G高达","name_cn":"机动武斗传G高达","date":"1994-01-01","year":"1994","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"49集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20230909-1/66b658168ebb5b5b99c7c5661cde5408.jpg"},"summary":"在未来世纪（Future Century，F.C.）由于地球严重被污染，人类移往宇宙殖民星，建立了新中国、新日本、新美国等殖民星国。各国在地球虽然还存有领土，但已受到严重的忽视。为了避免战争，各国决定以一场高达擂台赛(Gundam Fight，高达武斗)来决定各殖民星国对地球的统治权。比赛每四年一度，以地球为擂台，每个国家（殖民星）派出一位代表参赛，一对一以高达对战，直至只有一名胜利者。胜利者所属国家可擭得各殖民星国及地球管理权四年，直至另一个国家在下一次高达对决获胜。而活在地球上的居民，便要忍受在各国代表在对战时所造成的破坏。故事发生在未来世纪六十年开始，当时正开始第十三届高达擂台赛。故事的主角，来自新日本的code error!，为了追寻盗去以DG细胞三大理论，自我增殖、自我再生、自我进化设计出来的code error!(Devil Gundam)的兄长，决定参加这一次的高达对决，故事就此展开。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-09 09:02:17","playable":true,"episodeCount":49,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/BigrwGXp/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/6ocxngIT/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/bY1XqNNG/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/bx6NlUP8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/vVL7i8U1/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/Je2XGJV9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/xiRJogay/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/BDE20euD/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/bicQfbBa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/6ObIMHjZ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/Mekdwi9C/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/USChswYT/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20230907/5pamS1DO/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx1